
# Pie.org: Tools to put users back in control of the internet, starting with Pie Adblock

> Pie (The People's Internet Experiment) is building tools to put people in control of their internet experiences while supporting creators and publishers in a balanced, sustainable ecosystem. Pie aims to create a healthier internet ecosystem where users, creators, publishers, and advertisers can all benefit. Pie Adblock, its primary product, blocks ads effectively and supports content creators. Pie Adblock now has over 2 million users.

Key terms: Ad Blocker, Ad Blocking, Creator Support, Publisher Support, User Control, Internet Experience, Affiliate Link Protection, Stand-Down Policy, afsrc=1, Privacy, Transparency, Open Source, YouTube Ad Blocking, Twitch Ad Blocking, Visual Mode, Sustainable Ecosystem, Chrome Extension, Safari Extension, iOS App

## Products

* [Pie Adblock](https://www.pie.org): Revolutionary ad blocker available for Chromium browsers and as an iOS/macOS app for Safari. It blocks video ads on YouTube and Twitch, plus banners, pop-ups, and other intrusive ads across the web, with constant updates for robust blocking.

## Pie Adblock Features

- YouTube & Twitch Adblock: Say goodbye to ads on streaming services! A team of real humans are always working to block video ads that slip past other ad blockers.
- Advanced Features: Enjoy all advanced adblocker features at no cost to you: robust ad-blocking methods, enhanced popup suppression, plus more.
- Visual Mode: See the power of our ad blocking technology in action as ads are zapped away.
- Creator Support: Includes a video player overlay on YouTube and Twitch allowing users to easily allow ads for specific creators or all subscribed/followed channels with a click.

