## Ecosystem Support

- **Users:** Provides ad/tracker control, blocks disruptive video ads, and allows easy support for creators/publishers.
- **Creators:** Helps earnings via affiliate protection (stand-down policy), user support overlays, and direct partnerships (sponsorships@pie.org).
- **Publishers:** Encourages site support and aims to enable micropayments. Contact: publishers@pie.org.

## Business Model & Philosophy

- **Core Belief:** Empower users with control and foster a balanced internet ecosystem where content is funded fairly.
- **Free Product:** Pie Adblock and its advanced features are free.
- **How Pie Doesn't Make Money:** Does not swap ads, poach affiliate/creator commission, or sell user data.
- **Transparency & Privacy:** Committed to building in public, clear business models, user feedback (product@pie.org), never selling user data, and open source code.

